{"version":1,"content":"<p>47歲「金牌司儀」陸浩明（6號）是圈中出名的孝順仔，日前他現身理工大學出席胞弟陸浩輝（Felix）戴四方帽的畢業禮。</p><p>眼見細佬學有所成，身為哥哥的他難掩喜悅，在社交平台發文為細佬展開人生新一頁全力打氣。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T13:21:44.096994+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T13:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T13:18:22.566697+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T13:18:22.566697+00:00","content_hash":"73ec11899404ba4faf93216395e76120070b7f537fbd7df6cdeaaa99ba354b73","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}